   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1767000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Client \u2192 private DNS (Mac 1) \u2192 HTTPS edge / load balancer (Mac 2) \u2192 Backend A (Mac 3) / Backend B (Mac 4)   |   Phase 1: Build & Observe   \u00b7   Phase 2: Harden & Recover   \u00b7   Final: Explain & Defend",
   "originalText": "Client \u2192 private DNS (Mac 1) \u2192 HTTPS edge / load balancer (Mac 2) \u2192 Backend A (Mac 3) / Backend B (Mac 4)   |   Phase 1: Build & Observe   \u00b7   Phase 2: Harden & Recover   \u00b7   Final: Explain & Defend",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 18,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
