   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\"The application stays simple \u2014 the network is the project.\"   Repo: github.com/CODERNSINGH/CN-Project-Naren   \u00b7   Sections: 1 Topology \u00b7 2 Request flow \u00b7 3 Layers \u00b7 4 Phase 1 tasks \u00b7 5 Failures \u00b7 6 Phase 2 \u00b7 7 Build order \u00b7 8 Demo + troubleshooting \u00b7 9 Repo + ports",
   "originalText": "\"The application stays simple \u2014 the network is the project.\"   Repo: github.com/CODERNSINGH/CN-Project-Naren   \u00b7   Sections: 1 Topology \u00b7 2 Request flow \u00b7 3 Layers \u00b7 4 Phase 1 tasks \u00b7 5 Failures \u00b7 6 Phase 2 \u00b7 7 Build order \u00b7 8 Demo + troubleshooting \u00b7 9 Repo + ports",
