   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Rules: all Macs same network \u00b7 VPN off \u00b7 iCloud Private Relay off \u00b7 router AP/client isolation OFF \u00b7 hosts reach each other via ARP \u2192 MAC, gateway only for outside destinations",
   "originalText": "Rules: all Macs same network \u00b7 VPN off \u00b7 iCloud Private Relay off \u00b7 router AP/client isolation OFF \u00b7 hosts reach each other via ARP \u2192 MAC, gateway only for outside destinations",
