   "text": "IP: 10.7.16.221\ndnsmasq on :53 (UDP+TCP)\nzone team1.test (local, not forwarded)\napp.team1.test \u2192 10.7.2.91\napi.team1.test \u2192 10.7.2.91\nclient tools: dig, curl, browser, Wireshark\ndemos + diagnose.sh + failures.sh\nCloud \u2248 Amazon Route 53",
   "originalText": "IP: 10.7.16.221\ndnsmasq on :53 (UDP+TCP)\nzone team1.test (local, not forwarded)\napp.team1.test \u2192 10.7.2.91\napi.team1.test \u2192 10.7.2.91\nclient tools: dig, curl, browser, Wireshark\ndemos + diagnose.sh + failures.sh\nCloud \u2248 Amazon Route 53",
