   "text": "Mac 2 \u2014 EDGE: nginx proxy + LB + TLS (THIS laptop)  \u2014 Narendra",
   "originalText": "Mac 2 \u2014 EDGE: nginx proxy + LB + TLS (THIS laptop)  \u2014 Narendra",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
