   "text": "IP: 10.7.1.186\nFlask REST on 0.0.0.0:3001\nheader X-Backend: A\n/  /api/status  /api/catalog  /health\nPhase 2: backup dnsmasq (Ext A)\nPhase 2: standby nginx, X-Edge: standby (Ext E)\nPhase 2: pf firewall \u2192 only Mac 2 \u2192 :3001 (Ext C)\nCloud \u2248 EC2 / container instance A",
