   "text": "Transport-layer notes for the viva",
   "originalText": "Transport-layer notes for the viva",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 17,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  },
  {
   "id": "el0173",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 12,
   "y": 2313.25,
   "width": 1276,
   "height": 70.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1831006406,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 419072900,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1767000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Socket pair (4-tuple) = (client IP, client ephemeral port, edge IP, 8443) uniquely identifies the connection.\nReliability: sequence numbers number bytes, ACKs confirm, loss \u2192 retransmission (timeout / dup ACKs), checksum detects corruption.\nFlow control = receiver window (protects receiver). Congestion control = cwnd, slow start, AIMD (protects network).\nTCP = connection-oriented, reliable. UDP = connectionless (DNS, QUIC/HTTP3). DNS uses UDP/53 for small answers, TCP for big ones.",
   "originalText": "Socket pair (4-tuple) = (client IP, client ephemeral port, edge IP, 8443) uniquely identifies the connection.\nReliability: sequence numbers number bytes, ACKs confirm, loss \u2192 retransmission (timeout / dup ACKs), checksum detects corruption.\nFlow control = receiver window (protects receiver). Congestion control = cwnd, slow start, AIMD (protects network).\nTCP = connection-oriented, reliable. UDP = connectionless (DNS, QUIC/HTTP3). DNS uses UDP/53 for small answers, TCP for big ones.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  },
