   "text": "Join same Wi-Fi; record IP, mask, gateway, interface, MAC.\nPing every pair (12 directed pairs).\nDraw topology diagram.\nRUN: ./scripts/my_ip.sh \u00b7 ./scripts/check_lan.sh\nEVIDENCE: IP table, ping screenshots, diagram",
   "originalText": "Join same Wi-Fi; record IP, mask, gateway, interface, MAC.\nPing every pair (12 directed pairs).\nDraw topology diagram.\nRUN: ./scripts/my_ip.sh \u00b7 ./scripts/check_lan.sh\nEVIDENCE: IP table, ping screenshots, diagram",
