   "text": "brew install dnsmasq; records app/api \u2192 10.7.2.91.\n\u22652 clients use Mac 1 as resolver.\nAccess app by NAME only.\nRUN: ./scripts/setup_dnsmasq.sh primary \u00b7 ./scripts/set_dns.sh primary\nVERIFY: dig app.team1.test \u00b7 nslookup \u00b7 scutil --dns\nEVIDENCE: dnsmasq.conf, dig from 2 clients",
   "originalText": "brew install dnsmasq; records app/api \u2192 10.7.2.91.\n\u22652 clients use Mac 1 as resolver.\nAccess app by NAME only.\nRUN: ./scripts/setup_dnsmasq.sh primary \u00b7 ./scripts/set_dns.sh primary\nVERIFY: dig app.team1.test \u00b7 nslookup \u00b7 scutil --dns\nEVIDENCE: dnsmasq.conf, dig from 2 clients",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
