   "locked": false,
   "text": "Flask REST, bind 0.0.0.0 (not 127.0.0.1).\nGET /  \u00b7  GET /api/status \u2192 {backend, status}\nHeader X-Backend: A|B on every response.\nPorts A=3001, B=3002.\nRUN: ./backend/run_backend.sh\nEVIDENCE: curl -i from ANOTHER Mac, lsof showing *:3001",
   "originalText": "Flask REST, bind 0.0.0.0 (not 127.0.0.1).\nGET /  \u00b7  GET /api/status \u2192 {backend, status}\nHeader X-Backend: A|B on every response.\nPorts A=3001, B=3002.\nRUN: ./backend/run_backend.sh\nEVIDENCE: curl -i from ANOTHER Mac, lsof showing *:3001",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
