   "text": "nginx upstream with both backends, round-robin (or least_conn).\nRepeated curl alternates A,B,A,B.\nWhy clients never need backend IPs.\nRUN: ./scripts/configure_nginx.sh\nVERIFY: ./scripts/demo_lb.sh\nEVIDENCE: nginx.conf, nginx -t, loop output",
   "originalText": "nginx upstream with both backends, round-robin (or least_conn).\nRepeated curl alternates A,B,A,B.\nWhy clients never need backend IPs.\nRUN: ./scripts/configure_nginx.sh\nVERIFY: ./scripts/demo_lb.sh\nEVIDENCE: nginx.conf, nginx -t, loop output",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
