   "text": "/api/catalog: Cache-Control: max-age=60 + ETag.\n/api/status: no-store (dynamic).\nShow curl -I, then If-None-Match \u2192 304.\nBrowser DevTools shows memory/disk cache.\nRUN: ./scripts/demo_cache.sh\nEXPLAIN: fresh hit vs conditional (304) vs full 200",
