   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Flush DNS, make a fresh request, capture on en0.\nShow: DNS q/a (53/UDP) \u00b7 TCP SYN/SYN-ACK/ACK \u00b7 TLS ClientHello/ServerHello/Cert \u00b7\n  encrypted data \u00b7 alternating X-Backend.\nSave evidence/phase1.pcapng (+ tls12.pcapng with --tlsv1.2).\nRUN: ./scripts/capture.sh phase1 (CLI) or Wireshark GUI",
   "originalText": "Flush DNS, make a fresh request, capture on en0.\nShow: DNS q/a (53/UDP) \u00b7 TCP SYN/SYN-ACK/ACK \u00b7 TLS ClientHello/ServerHello/Cert \u00b7\n  encrypted data \u00b7 alternating X-Backend.\nSave evidence/phase1.pcapng (+ tls12.pcapng with --tlsv1.2).\nRUN: ./scripts/capture.sh phase1 (CLI) or Wireshark GUI",
