   "updated": 1767000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "BREAK: APP_IP=10.7.8.104 ./setup_dnsmasq.sh primary + flush\nSEE: dig succeeds, but client lands on the wrong host (refused\n  / cert mismatch)\nWHY: DNS is a directory, not a connection \u2014 it can't know if\n  the target is right or alive\nLAYER: DNS data",
   "originalText": "BREAK: APP_IP=10.7.8.104 ./setup_dnsmasq.sh primary + flush\nSEE: dig succeeds, but client lands on the wrong host (refused\n  / cert mismatch)\nWHY: DNS is a directory, not a connection \u2014 it can't know if\n  the target is right or alive\nLAYER: DNS data",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": null,
