   "text": "7. Build order \u2014 who runs what, in which order (full detail in each Mac's README and GUIDE_END_TO_END.md)",
   "originalText": "7. Build order \u2014 who runs what, in which order (full detail in each Mac's README and GUIDE_END_TO_END.md)",
