   "updated": 1767000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Single points of failure \u2192 fixes:  edge nginx (2 edges + VRRP/keepalived, health-checked DNS, cloud LB) \u00b7 DNS (backup resolver) \u00b7 LAN/router (redundant paths) \u00b7 one CA/cert (rotate, 2 issuers)",
   "originalText": "Single points of failure \u2192 fixes:  edge nginx (2 edges + VRRP/keepalived, health-checked DNS, cloud LB) \u00b7 DNS (backup resolver) \u00b7 LAN/router (redundant paths) \u00b7 one CA/cert (rotate, 2 issuers)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "baseline": 16,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
