   "updated": 1767000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Cloud map:  dnsmasq = Route 53 \u00b7 nginx = ALB / CDN edge \u00b7 backends = EC2 / containers \u00b7 pf = security groups \u00b7 DNS cutover = Route 53 weighted / failover routing \u00b7 mkcert/OpenSSL CA = ACM / private CA",
   "originalText": "Cloud map:  dnsmasq = Route 53 \u00b7 nginx = ALB / CDN edge \u00b7 backends = EC2 / containers \u00b7 pf = security groups \u00b7 DNS cutover = Route 53 weighted / failover routing \u00b7 mkcert/OpenSSL CA = ACM / private CA",
